# The geoDC clone the harness works on (bootstrap.ps1 / bootstrap.sh); it is a repository of its own.
/geodc

# Screenshot corpora (dev/capture-views.ps1, dev/capture-ds-previews.ps1): regenerable, and large
dev/captures/

